 prompt=f'''Production game environment: {name}. {STYLE}\nCreate a full-bleed portrait bare background, 1120x2048, theme: {theme}. No buildings, houses, huts, ruins, mechanical structures, people, bees, foundations, UI, furniture or letters anywhere. The final playable original is the central 854x1842 crop at (133,103); top 18 percent and bottom 12 percent of that inner crop are UI-safe scenic margin. Five future building sites must be broad naturally flat softly lighter terrain clearings centered approximately as follows: {site}. Keep each clearing at least 0.35 of full image width, without visibly painted circles, outlines or pads. On a hillside use broad terraces. Paths connect the clearings, sparse scenery at outside edges only; no path, large tree, pond or rock through a site. Lightly elevated perspective consistent with reference. Main upper middle clearing's feet point is its FRONT edge: clear terrain must extend UP behind that point for the building. Landscape behind top UI continues naturally. Do not copy the reference houses.''' 
