 for bid,bname,desc in bs:
  prompt=f'''Production upgrade SPRITE SHEET for ONE building {bname}: {desc}. {STYLE}\nCanvas EXACTLY THREE COLUMNS by TWO ROWS, six equally sized cells. Top row left-right L0 L1 L2; bottom row left-right L3 L4 L5. EXACTLY SIX complete separate objects, no detached objects outside their own cell. All 6 states in same viewpoint, physical pixel scale and feet baseline, with generous empty margins each side (at least 10 percent cell width) and no cropped parts. L0 is ONLY low empty architectural honeycomb foundation with small bamboo/stone pegs, no finished roof or walls. L1 a simple functional small building, approximately 60 percent L5 height; L2 adds actual new functional structure; L3 complete function, approximately 80 percent L5 height; L4 adds architectural volume and useful equipment; L5 largest most elaborate version with richer roof, honeycomb crest, warm amber lanterns and ornaments. Progressive building growth and functional geometry changes, NOT 6 recolors, NOT 6 scaled copies. L5 never shrinks below earlier levels. Keep main walls/structures continuous not fragmented.\nBackground MUST be perfectly flat solid pure magenta #FF00FF including all gaps under eaves and between rails. Magenta is the removable background only, not part of buildings. Avoid magenta/pink building colors: any cherry petals are coral-peach, not purple or magenta. NO green lawn tile, no water tile, no landscape base or ground plane, no cast shadow on magenta. Small structural plinth belongs to object; isolated object only. No grid lines, no labels, no level text. Do not reproduce the reference UI or complete village. Render only this specified ONE building in six upgrades.'''
  refs=[V/'效果图/S03_建造页_BlockHexa风格.png',V/'素材/建筑/B01_蜂巢主屋/B01_L5.png']
